# DipanProj_MapEditor — 同步腳本產出的素材副本（由 sync_assets.sh 從主專案拷貝，不進版控）
/DipanProj_MapEditor/Assets/StreamingAssets/MapAssets/
/DipanProj_MapEditor/Assets/StreamingAssets/MapAssets.meta

# DipanProj_MapEditor — 特效庫與換色匯出，已移到 Assets 外（Unity 不追蹤、編輯器不變慢；可用 organize_effects.py 重跑產生，不進版控）
/DipanProj_MapEditor/Effects/
/DipanProj_MapEditor/Effects_Recolored/
# 下載回來的原始特效包（龐大原始素材，整理進 Effects/ 後就不需進版控）
/DipanProj_MapEditor/allEffects/
# 舊位置殘留的孤兒 .meta（Unity 下次 refresh 會自動清）
/DipanProj_MapEditor/Assets/StreamingAssets/Effects.meta
/DipanProj_MapEditor/Assets/StreamingAssets/Effects_Recolored.meta

# DipanProj_MapEditor — 購買的原始特效包（大量二進位素材，各自留本機，不進版控）
/DipanProj_MapEditor/Assets/Resources/Super Pixel Effects Gigapack/
/DipanProj_MapEditor/Assets/Resources/Super Pixel Effects Gigapack.meta

# DipanProj_Main — Sync Map Assets 從 GameAssets 產生的衍生素材副本，不進版控（打包前先跑一次 Sync）
/DipanProj_Main/Assets/StreamingAssets/MapAssets/
/DipanProj_Main/Assets/StreamingAssets/MapAssets.meta

